                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "91c19b96-323f-322c-8947-0b9a87bda156",
                        "entry_id": "e53a1956-6890-33be-a216-6370065e68e1",
                        "glosses": [
                            "разг., уничиж. то же, что шизофреник"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b7334f73-c88b-4608-9b91-1dd0bbfdcac0",
                                "sense_id": "91c19b96-323f-322c-8947-0b9a87bda156",
                                "text": "Блатные о Гамлете: «Тоже он, всё на придурка косил, на шизика! Быть или не быть! Надо было сразу мочить короля, а то ходил, ходил, вот и доигрался! Не сумел толком за папаню постоять»."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "aabf5fe2-8b19-4f6a-bf4c-9cf0e98f78a1",
                                "sense_id": "91c19b96-323f-322c-8947-0b9a87bda156",
                                "text": "Это шизики сами с собой разговаривают. А он не шиз, он нормальный, он более чем нормален, он видит древнее зло, ползущее в мир…"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d76f4983-0f11-4088-9bed-c1bc8834847d",
                        "source_entry_id": "e53a1956-6890-33be-a216-6370065e68e1",
                        "source_sense_id": "91c19b96-323f-322c-8947-0b9a87bda156",
                        "target_lang_word": "schizzy",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "schizzy",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "df1ce3c6-01c2-3975-afa1-7ab944cf05bd",
                                        "entry_id": "3f4346eb-4b95-36eb-93e4-337420e81029",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "schizoid, schizophrenic; crazy"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a7a4053b-e995-44c2-b807-f9b46ed8cf5a",
                                                "sense_id": "df1ce3c6-01c2-3975-afa1-7ab944cf05bd",
                                                "text": "But a Russian, in my observation, can go schizzy from just about anything, except from losing his job. She went schizzy. She was depressed for almost two years and still has her ups and downs."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c3558b1c-7ceb-40c9-975a-08ea19e910b0",
                                                "sense_id": "df1ce3c6-01c2-3975-afa1-7ab944cf05bd",
                                                "text": "Typically he's schizzy or immature or homosexual, or in the exceptional cases such as you have to deal with, a total psychotic personality."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "41c0f1e4-16ad-4c88-a867-1e7f881b598d",
                                                "sense_id": "df1ce3c6-01c2-3975-afa1-7ab944cf05bd",
                                                "text": "But, to cite an older example, not everything that schizophrenics say or think is \"schizzy,\" and some of the things that are are not schizzy in principle, only in mode or degree of realization."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0615b980-c6fc-4eef-a5c5-9cbdcb7fa1f7",
                        "source_entry_id": "e53a1956-6890-33be-a216-6370065e68e1",
                        "source_sense_id": "91c19b96-323f-322c-8947-0b9a87bda156",
                        "target_lang_word": "schizy",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "schizy",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c273ab9b-44e9-3469-aa5b-0d6f8764b6b9",
                                        "entry_id": "84df3a7e-8840-31c9-a5e4-93d44b7fb564",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "schizoid, schizophrenic"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "offensive",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ec68739c-57cb-44ec-a9b0-e023b26b9bb6",
                                                "sense_id": "c273ab9b-44e9-3469-aa5b-0d6f8764b6b9",
                                                "text": "1979, G.H. Hill, Interview with Norton Cabal, Principia Discordia Loompanics, S.F.\nGypsie: Hey, guy, later. [to Hill]: Doesn't this leave you a little schizy?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "feeee85a-4c92-4060-bb1b-4ac98493257e",
                                                "sense_id": "c273ab9b-44e9-3469-aa5b-0d6f8764b6b9",
                                                "text": "If Maggie the performer is flamboyantly flexible, her backstage persona is downright schizy."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "72134dd1-dd17-4d6f-b0fd-39de09ceec26",
                        "source_entry_id": "e53a1956-6890-33be-a216-6370065e68e1",
                        "source_sense_id": "91c19b96-323f-322c-8947-0b9a87bda156",
                        "target_lang_word": "schizo",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "schizo",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "47316e29-074e-3dff-8040-bb742c86200d",
                                        "entry_id": "bab455d7-ae3a-3441-8924-edc64c9b10bb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Schizophrenic."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "offensive",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e0bbf5b7-61b0-4984-8756-dab2a8d26631",
                                                "sense_id": "47316e29-074e-3dff-8040-bb742c86200d",
                                                "text": "\"Lucky for you you aren't in one of our great public hospitals; they put the loonies next to the heroin addicts, and there's so much drug traffic in the wards that the poor schizos end up with bad habits.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bebb0570-41a8-3208-b98c-837f74981695",
                                        "entry_id": "bab455d7-ae3a-3441-8924-edc64c9b10bb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A mad or crazy person."
                                        ],
